---
import TextPage from "../../layouts/TextPage.astro";
---

<TextPage
  lang="en"
  title="Test report"
  description="How I tested this website: load time, accessibility, screen sizes, privacy and the bugs I found."
  alternate="/testbericht/"
>
  <h1>Test report</h1>
  <p>
    Before this website went live, I tested it the way I would test software for customers: clear
    criteria, automated checks and a list of the bugs I found.
  </p>
  <p class="note">
    Test date: 26 October 2026, repeated on 27 October 2026 · Environment: local production build · Chromium 141 · Lighthouse
    12.8 · axe-core 4.14 · Playwright 1.56
  </p>

  <h2>Results at a glance</h2>
  <div class="table-scroll">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Area</th><th>Criterion</th><th>Result</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Load time</td><td>Lighthouse performance, mobile / desktop</td><td>99 / 100</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Load time</td><td>Largest Contentful Paint, mobile (throttled)</td><td>1.8 s</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Stability</td><td>Cumulative Layout Shift</td><td>0</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Accessibility</td><td>Lighthouse accessibility</td><td>100</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Accessibility</td><td>axe-core, WCAG 2.1 A and AA, all 6 pages</td><td>0 violations</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Quality</td><td>Lighthouse best practices and SEO</td><td>100 / 100</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Screen sizes</td><td>320 to 1920 px wide, no horizontal scrolling</td><td>passed</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Privacy</td><td>Requests to third parties, cookies</td><td>none / 0</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Links</td><td>All internal links reachable</td><td>passed</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>What I checked</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Keyboard:</strong> every link can be reached with Tab in a sensible order. The first
      Tab shows "Skip to content", and focus is always clearly visible.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Motion:</strong> the animated background stays still when the system setting "reduce
      motion" is on. It pauses when scrolled out of view or in a background tab to save battery.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Languages:</strong> German and English with their own URLs and correct language
      markup, so screen readers and search engines pick the right language.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Privacy:</strong> fonts are served by this website itself. Loading the page contacts no
      other server and sets no cookies.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Bugs found and fixed</h2>
  <div class="table-scroll">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>#</th><th>Bug</th><th>Cause</th><th>Fix</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>1</td>
          <td>axe reports "region": content outside landmarks (5 places)</td>
          <td>The top area with name and links was not a landmark</td>
          <td>Marked up the top area as <code>&lt;header&gt;</code></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>2</td>
          <td>Horizontal scrolling at 320 px width (27 px)</td>
          <td>The long German word "Anwendungsentwicklung" did not fit</td>
          <td>Automatic hyphenation for headings</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>3</td>
          <td>"Test report" link led to an empty page (404)</td>
          <td>The page was linked but not created yet</td>
          <td>This page</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>After the fixes I ran every check again. The results above are from that second run.</p>

  <h2>Still open</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Automated tests ran in Chromium only. Firefox and Safari are next, by hand.</li>
    <li>Load time was measured locally. Values on GitHub Pages may differ slightly.</li>
  </ul>
</TextPage>
